==Restrictions==
Deploy from Row 1 only

==Battleground==
===<u>Chapter 1</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Hyppoh|Shibalien Elite|Star Peng|Maawth|Ursamajor}}
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~36.67 seconds<sup>800f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Star Peng]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Maawth]] spawns.

===<u>Chapter 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Hyppoh|Shibalien Elite|Star Peng|Ribbo|Ursamajor}}
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~36.67 seconds<sup>800f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Star Peng]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Ribbo]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Hyppoh|Shibalien Elite|Star Peng|Ribbo|Ursamajor}}
*1 [[Hyppoh]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~36.67 seconds<sup>800f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Star Peng]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ursamajor]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Ribbo]] spawns.

==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Because of the one-row limit, you'll have to place your best cats, usually only having 1-2 meatshields, 1-2 attackers, and a [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Unit]].

==='''Chapter 2 & 3'''===
Like Chapter 1, because of the one-row limit, you'll have to protect your best cats with 2-3 meatshields, 1-2 attackers, 1-2 DPS/Crowd Controlling units. Remember to bring either a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] or the Breakerblast Cannon for the Ribbos.

