==Trivia==
*A parody unit of [[wikia:gundam:MA-08 Big Zam|MA-08 Big Zam]] is seen riding the Pegasus White Base, both from the ''[[wikipedia:Mobile Suit Gundam|Mobile Suit Gundam]]'' series.
*Thanxbye on the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] map looks exactly like ''Mobile Suit Gundam''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s [[wikia:gundam:Space Colony (UC)#Side 3|Side 3]] colony. This is further supported by the stage's [[Treasure]], a Space Colony, and how Thanxbye's Japanese name (マイドムリ Maidomuri) is pronounced similarly to Side 3 in Japanese (サイド・スリー Saido Surī).
*Thanxbye was called "Thanxabunch" in [[The Battle Cats POP!]]
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], this stage is changed to have the same schematics as [[Machu Picchu (Into the Future)|Machu Picchu]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

